  "bodyHtml": "<h2>Customer enquiries</h2><p>To help us respond efficiently, please include:</p><ul><li>The name of the product you are asking about.</li><li>For order questions, the order or receipt reference from your payment provider.</li><li>A short description of your question or the issue you are experiencing.</li></ul><h3>Payments and receipts</h3><p>Payments are processed by a third-party payment provider, which issues your receipt. For billing questions please keep that receipt to hand.</p><h3>Before you contact us</h3><p>Our <a href=\"refund-policy.html\">Refund Policy</a> and the frequently asked questions on each product page may already answer your question.</p>"
